{"id":"4984","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4984_main_cumulus-humilis_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>航拍图像从上方显示了积云。云元素通常是密集的，但是以相对随机的模式排列。只有有限的垂直发展，云的外观通常是扁平的，表明这是淡云云种（CL = 1）。报告的云底高度为5000英尺，云顶估计约为6000英尺。地面数据来自法国巴黎戴高乐机场的观测。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Frank Le Blancq","location":"法国北部","latitude":"纬度: 49° 15' 56'' N","longitude":"经度: 3° 12' 5'' E","date":"05 June 2014 1648 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东北","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: S.9.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.9.1"},{"src":"/images/compressed/syn/4984_syn_cumulus-humilis_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>该区域处于一道弱高压脊下，位于黑海低压和比斯开湾以西991 hPa的低压之间。当天早些时候，该地区一直处于极地海上气流中。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 德国气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/upper/4984_upper_cumulus-humilis_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>1200 UTC时，法国特拉普（WMO 07145）的探测表明边界层不稳定。 在830hPa下存在2°C的逆温，上面则是非常干燥的空气。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}